---
system: sys-01-identity-household-access
flow_id: login
surface: mobile
spec_anchor: /software/systems/01-identity-household-access#post-v1authlogin
actors: [ParentApp, Gateway, IdentityService, SES]
apis:
  - POST /v1/auth/login
  - POST /v1/auth/refresh
externals: [SES]
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - invalid_credentials
  - account_disabled
  - login_rate_limited
  - mfa_required
idempotency: client-supplied X-Request-Id, 24h dedup window
retry: caller-side exponential backoff with jitter on 5xx
timeout: 5s p99
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway
    participant IdentityService
    participant SES

    ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/auth/login {email, password, deviceName, platform, X-Request-Id}
    Gateway->>Gateway: rate-limit (sys-17) — 5 per minute per IP plus email
    Gateway->>IdentityService: forward request
    alt invalid_credentials
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 401 invalid_credentials
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 401
    else account_disabled
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 423 account_disabled
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 423
    else login_rate_limited
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 429 login_rate_limited
    else success
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 200 {access_token, refresh_token, expires_in}
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
        IdentityService-)SES: (async via queue auth.email) login_notice email
    end

    Note over ParentApp,IdentityService: timeout 5s p99 — caller-side retry with jitter on 5xx — idempotent via X-Request-Id
